WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.688
Why now?

00:00:03.768 --> 00:00:07.456
Prior momentum proofs need a coefficient shrinking
to zero,

00:00:07.536 --> 00:00:11.224
but practitioners fix it near zero point nine.

00:00:11.304 --> 00:00:14.992
Prior AdaGrad results cover a modified form, not
the standard one.

00:00:15.072 --> 00:00:18.760
It drops convexity, bounded-iterate, and
bounded-noise assumptions.
